{"id":"68b47b6e126cab37","group":"73","path":"73/73-thm-cfl-closure-and-nonclosure.md","title":"73-thm-cfl-closure-and-nonclosure — cfl closure and nonclosure","display":"73-thm-cfl-closure-and-nonclosure — cfl closure and nonclosure","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-thm-cfl-closure-and-nonclosure","display":"73-thm-cfl-closure-and-nonclosure — cfl closure and nonclosure","depends_on":["[[73-df-cfl-notation]]","[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]","[[73-thm-cfg-positive-closure]]","[[73-thm-cfl-nonclosure-examples]]"],"aliases":["73-thm-cfl-closure-and-nonclosure","73-theorem-3.3"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-thm-cfl-closure-and-nonclosure"},{"key":"display","html":"73-thm-cfl-closure-and-nonclosure — cfl closure and nonclosure"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"351f87e03faac193\" href=\"?note=351f87e03faac193\" title=\"73-df-cfl-notation\">73-df-cfl-notation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0a6da8c909717780\" href=\"?note=0a6da8c909717780\" title=\"73-df-finite-words-and-languages\">73-df-finite-words-and-languages</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"02910c90a7bc9f14\" href=\"?note=02910c90a7bc9f14\" title=\"73-thm-cfg-positive-closure\">73-thm-cfg-positive-closure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"08a47204ea81e603\" href=\"?note=08a47204ea81e603\" title=\"73-thm-cfl-nonclosure-examples\">73-thm-cfl-nonclosure-examples</a></span></div>"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-thm-cfl-closure-and-nonclosure</span><span>73-theorem-3.3</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\\)</span>；有限词、单字符词和拼接见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0a6da8c909717780\" href=\"?note=0a6da8c909717780\" title=\"73-df-finite-words-and-languages\">73-df-finite-words-and-languages</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CFL}\">\\(\\mathrm{CFL}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"351f87e03faac193\" href=\"?note=351f87e03faac193\" title=\"73-df-cfl-notation\">73-df-cfl-notation</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_1,L_2\\in\\mathrm{CFL}\">\\(L_1,L_2\\in\\mathrm{CFL}\\)</span>。补集的全集为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma^*\">\\(\\Sigma^*\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>第二个断言仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\Sigma|\\ge3\">\\(|\\Sigma|\\ge3\\)</span> 时主张存在反例；不存在把“通常不封闭”解释成每一对语言的交都不是 CFL 的约定。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}3.3}\\vdash\nL_1\\cup L_2\\in\\mathrm{CFL}\\land L_1L_2\\in\\mathrm{CFL}\\land L_1^*\\in\\mathrm{CFL}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}3.3}\\vdash\nL_1\\cup L_2\\in\\mathrm{CFL}\\land L_1L_2\\in\\mathrm{CFL}\\land L_1^*\\in\\mathrm{CFL}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}3.3}\\vdash\n|\\Sigma|\\ge3\\to\n\\bigl((\\exists A,B\\in\\mathrm{CFL}\\;A\\cap B\\notin\\mathrm{CFL})\n\\land(\\exists C\\in\\mathrm{CFL}\\;\\Sigma^*\\setminus C\\notin\\mathrm{CFL})\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}3.3}\\vdash\n|\\Sigma|\\ge3\\to\n\\bigl((\\exists A,B\\in\\mathrm{CFL}\\;A\\cap B\\notin\\mathrm{CFL})\n\\land(\\exists C\\in\\mathrm{CFL}\\;\\Sigma^*\\setminus C\\notin\\mathrm{CFL})\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>三字符子字母表上可用 a^n b^n c^m 与 a^m b^n c^n 作交不封闭见证；补不封闭由并封闭和 De Morgan 律推出。若全集字母表较大，仍用同一见证，不能略去反例所需字母表条件。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-cfl-notation","status":"resolved","id":"351f87e03faac193","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-cfl-notation]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","status":"resolved","id":"0a6da8c909717780","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-thm-cfg-positive-closure","status":"resolved","id":"02910c90a7bc9f14","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-thm-cfg-positive-closure]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-thm-cfl-nonclosure-examples","status":"resolved","id":"08a47204ea81e603","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-thm-cfl-nonclosure-examples]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","status":"resolved","id":"0a6da8c909717780","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 $\\Sigma$ 满足 $\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)$；有限词、单字符词和拼接见 [[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]。","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-cfl-notation","status":"resolved","id":"351f87e03faac193","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CFL}$ 见 [[73-df-cfl-notation]]；$L_1,L_2\\in\\mathrm{CFL}$。补集的全集为 $\\Sigma^*$。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CFL}","display":false},{"tex":"L_1,L_2\\in\\mathrm{CFL}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma^*","display":false},{"tex":"|\\Sigma|\\ge3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}3.3}\\vdash\nL_1\\cup L_2\\in\\mathrm{CFL}\\land L_1L_2\\in\\mathrm{CFL}\\land L_1^*\\in\\mathrm{CFL}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}3.3}\\vdash\n|\\Sigma|\\ge3\\to\n\\bigl((\\exists A,B\\in\\mathrm{CFL}\\;A\\cap B\\notin\\mathrm{CFL})\n\\land(\\exists C\\in\\mathrm{CFL}\\;\\Sigma^*\\setminus C\\notin\\mathrm{CFL})\\bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":1481,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["351f87e03faac193","0a6da8c909717780","02910c90a7bc9f14","08a47204ea81e603"]}